{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Repeating corridors, subtly distorted spaces. Can you escape this endless loop?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Phil in the Mirror&quot; is a first\u2011person psychological adventure game in the Metroidbrainia genre that combines <strong>light tension</strong> with <strong>simple observation\u2011based puzzles</strong>. Instead of complex controls or intense action, it focuses on unraveling mysteries through careful observation and deduction. The hints for the puzzles are always right before your eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Observe, deduce, and proceed.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870020/extras/c47044f57ccaea782936fd49449777fa.poster.avif?t=1757388859\" width=640 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870020/extras/c47044f57ccaea782936fd49449777fa.webm?t=1757388859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870020/extras/c47044f57ccaea782936fd49449777fa.mp4?t=1757388859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin on the 9th floor. Every hallway you traverse looks identical\u2014but it might not be. Scrutinize your surroundings to uncover any \u201canomalies.\u201d</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you discover an anomaly,</strong> immediately retrace your steps and return to the elevator you boarded.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If there is no anomaly,</strong> take the elevator at the end of the hallway to proceed to the next floor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you disobey these instructions,</strong> you will not be allowed to descend to the next floor.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This simple rule will put you to the test. Your powers of observation are literally your only means of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock sealed doors and enter hidden chambers.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870020/extras/ca6f3665ae1017547af4de8575d10604.poster.avif?t=1757388859\" width=640 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870020/extras/ca6f3665ae1017547af4de8575d10604.webm?t=1757388859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870020/extras/ca6f3665ae1017547af4de8575d10604.mp4?t=1757388859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Phil, you must explore various spaces and draw closer to the building\u2019s secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather countless clues to complete a single story. Then face the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this enigmatic realm, will you confront the truth and find the true exit?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3870020?t=1757388859","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3870020?t=1757388859","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870020/8d4db1ec26abc8c78e9ab90210ceed9b599387b2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757388859","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870020/8d4db1ec26abc8c78e9ab90210ceed9b599387b2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757388859","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"descriptio