vator you boarded.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If there is no anomaly,</strong> take the elevator at the end of the hallway to proceed to the next floor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you disobey these instructions,</strong> you will not be allowed to descend to the next floor.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This simple rule will put you to the test. Your powers of observation are literally your only means of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock sealed doors and enter hidden chambers.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870020/extras/ca6f3665ae1017547af4de8575d10604.poster.avif?t=1757388859\" width=640 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870020/extras/ca6f3665ae1017547af4de8575d10604.webm?t=1757388859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870020/extras/ca6f3665ae1017547af4de8575d10604.mp4?t=1757388859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Phil, you must explore various spaces and draw closer to the building\u2019s secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather countless clues to complete a single story. Then face the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this enigmatic realm, will you confront the truth and find the true exit?</strong></p>","developers":["Lunanod"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870020/87936177ce0358f68aebfb395fd04680d0486857/header.jpg?t=1757388859","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recomm